{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misolistitemicon"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An icon element that can be used at the leading or trailing position of a list item"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"such as ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOStaticListItem"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISONavigationListItem"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOListItemIcon","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon"},{"text":" displays a status icon (info, warning, positive, negative) with a predefined asset,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or a custom neutral icon from a provided image. Each icon type has a semantic color applied automatically","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"based on the current theme.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional notification badge can be attached to neutral icons to indicate additional status.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Status","anchor":"Status","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon\/IconStatus","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines the available icon variants:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".neutral(asset:badge:)"}]},{"text":": A custom icon from a provided ","type":"text"},{"code":"Image","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" asset, rendered with the default","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"content color. An optional notification badge (small dot) can be displayed at the top-trailing corner.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".positive"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A predefined checkmark\/confirmation icon with a positive (green) semantic color.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".info"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A predefined information icon with an informational (blue) semantic color."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".warning","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A predefined warning icon with a warning (yellow\/orange) semantic color."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This icon uses a two-layer rendering with distinct internal and external shape colors."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".negative"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A predefined alert\/important icon with a negative (red) semantic color."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Sizes","level":2,"anchor":"Sizes","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon\/Size","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines the available sizes:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".medium"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": The default size, corresponding to the theme’s "},{"code":"controlItem.sizeAssetMedium","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" token."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".large","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":": The largest size, corresponding to the theme’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"controlItem.sizeAssetLarge","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" token.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note:"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" When the icon is embedded in a list item with small size"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(via "},{"code":"SwiftUI\/View\/misoListItemSize(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), the icon is always rendered at its smallest size"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"regardless of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"size"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples","type":"heading","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Info icon with medium size (default)","    MISOListItemIcon(status: .info, description: \"Something new\")","","    \/\/ Warning icon with large size","    MISOListItemIcon(status: .warning, description: \"Mobile data almost used\", size: .large)","","    \/\/ Negative icon with medium size","    MISOListItemIcon(status: .negative, description: \"Payment failed\", size: .medium)","","    \/\/ Custom neutral icon without badge","    MISOListItemIcon(status: .neutral(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\"), descritpion: \"Emails\"))","","    \/\/ Custom neutral icon with notification badge","    MISOListItemIcon(status: .neutral(asset: Image(decorati